"Please **enable your video** or **leave the channel** or you will be disconnected {timestamp} and potentially **blacklisted**."
msgstr ""
"**你已加入視訊頻道{channel}！**\n"
"請**開啟視訊**或**離開頻道**，否則你將在{timestamp}被斷開連線並可能被**加入黑名單**。"

#: src/modules/video_channels/cog.py:316
